This output demonstrates how the system addresses each of the actions:
- Inventory Management: The system tracks the inventory levels of Apples and reduces waste by 50 units.
- Purchasing Practices: The system integrates supplier information by adding Farm A with a lead time of 7 days.
- Customer Education: The system displays educational materials in the Produce Section with tips for reducing food waste.
- Donation Programs: The system integrates the Food Bank donation organization that accepts donations of fresh produce.
