Yes, I can help you with that. Here's how you can implement the binary search algorithm in Java to find the smallest number in a sorted list of integers:
```
public static int findSmallestNumber(int[] lst) {
    int low = 0;
    int high = lst.length - 1;

    while (low < high) {
        int mid = (low + high) / 2;
        if (lst[mid] < lst[high]) {
            high = mid;
        } else {
            low = mid + 1;
        }
    }

    return lst[low];
}
```
